{
  "name": "@dsh-external/dsh-opencode-quota",
  "version": "0.9.8",
  "description": "Open GO 套餐额度小组件：收起为单行 pill（GO + 5h/wk/mo 三档读数），点击在 pill 上方就地展开锚定面板（5h 滚动 / 7d 每周 / 1m 每月三档额度条 + 距重置倒计时）；官方账单默认隐藏，由 ⚙ 弹窗里的开关打开（今日 / 本月按模型明细，打开才请求控制台接口）；⚙ 齿轮弹窗与「设置 → 插件 → opencode-quota」共用同一份配置（账单开关 / workspace id / 登录 cookie），齿轮保存会写回设置存储，一键刷新全部，开合状态持久化。凭据不出服务器。",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-settings": "^0.1.5-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.18.1"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "bin/modlens-wrap.cmd",
    "bin/modlens-append.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
